<title>SPAIN: ATHLETICS-MADRID MEETING POSTPONED UNTIL SEPTEMBER.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-MADRID MEETING POSTPONED UNTIL SEPTEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Madrid international meeting scheduled for June 27 has been postponed until early September.</p>
<p>Organisers said a number of Cuban athletes had not been available on the original date.</p>
</text>
